	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『魔神創造伝ワタル』より雷神丸が登場！",
			"風神丸と対になるような姿をしている、御羅院が乗りこむ魔神！",
			"• 部位ごとにパーツを分けられるシリーズ共通フレームを採用。他の魔神と組み合わせて遊ぼう！",
			"• パチパチと手で外せるタッチゲート仕様。接着剤無しで組み立てられる！",
			"• 背部の雷神の鼓や、雷鳴剣はクリアパーツで再現！",
			"• 2本の雷鳴剣は繋げて太刀へ変形可能！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Raijinmaru appears from “Mashin Souzouden Wataru”!",
			"A demon god that Gorain rides, which looks like a counterpart to Fujinmaru!",
			"• Adopts a common frame across the series that allows parts to be separated by area. Let's play in combination with other genies!",
			"• Touch gate design that can be removed by hand. Can be assembled without adhesive!",
			"• The thunder god's drum and thunder sword on the back are reproduced with clear parts!",
			"• Two thunder swords can be connected and transformed into a long sword!"
		]
	},
